{
  "meta": {
    "kind": "production",
    "id": "hurufi.production.literacy.wave9",
    "title": "Literacy path — Wave 9",
    "description": "Ninth production literacy slice: letter ع on the established SHOW → PRACTICE → TEST pattern. Compact two-unit wave. Fatha only. عَسَل is the single new Band A word. Medial س and final ل are prepared because earlier waves scored only سـ / ـس and medial ل. No ن, ه, خ, ط, madd, kasra, damma, hamza, required review, or Wave 10.",
    "notProductionCurriculum": false
  },
